## Layout

- `lib/main.dart` starts the app; `lib/ui/core/` holds the app, its theme and
  shared widgets.
- `lib/ui/<feature>/` holds one feature's views and view model; `lib/data/` its
  repositories and services; `lib/domain/models/` the immutable models.
- `test/` mirrors `lib/`.
